# HOME COMING — routing
# Netlify and Cloudflare Pages read this automatically.

# The bare address should land on the wedding page.
/              /Index.html   301
/index.html    /             301

# A friend who taps a link with a typo, or an old link from before you renamed
# something, should land on the page rather than on a raw server error.
/home          /Index.html   301
/blessing      /Index.html#blessing  301

# Nothing else exists. Rather than serve a directory listing, send them home.
# This is deliberately a 302 and not a 404, because a stranger guessing paths
# has no business getting a scary-looking error page.
/*            /Index.html   302